WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:03.420
♪♪

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.088
Gaal:
I think I can feel the future.

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:07.674
♪♪

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:11.011
Salvor:
I sort of know things, like I
knew to find you.

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.471
♪♪

00:00:12.471 --> 00:00:14.389
Queen Sareth:
I intend to find out the truth
about my family

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:15.390
Queen Sareth:
one way or another.

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:16.600
♪♪

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.811
Demerzel:
I can already see that wonderful
things lie ahead.

00:00:20.229 --> 00:00:24.733
David Goyer:
It was important to me that
Foundation be a show for a global audience

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:29.154
and that the entirety of that
global audience see themselves
reflected.

00:00:29.363 --> 00:00:33.909
David Goyer:
It allows us to tell some
stories that are not traditionally told on screen.

00:00:34.618 --> 00:00:39.414
David Goyer:
And these powerful characters
are integral to the Foundation saga.

00:00:39.498 --> 00:00:42.251
♪♪

00:00:42.251 --> 00:00:45.629
Season one Gaal is very young
and learning.

00:00:45.963 --> 00:00:47.714
Lou Llobell:
Season two she’s a lot more in
control.

00:00:49.132 --> 00:00:51.051
Gaal Dornick:
There are things happening here
that you don’t understand 

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:53.053
and right now you just need to
accept that.

00:00:53.095 --> 00:00:55.472
I’ve found a lot more confidence
this season.

00:00:56.348 --> 00:00:59.268
Lou Llobell:
I look at myself in those first
episodes in season one and 

00:00:59.268 --> 00:01:00.978
Lou Llobell:
I look at some of the stuff I’m
doing now, 

00:01:00.978 --> 00:01:04.398
Lou Llobell:
and I can’t quite
believe that it’s the same person and it’s me.

00:01:04.398 --> 00:01:08.568
Lou Llobell:
So, it is so fun to watch myself
grow as much as Gaal.

00:01:09.778 --> 00:01:10.779
Salvor Hardin:
My name 

00:01:11.113 --> 00:01:12.239
is Salvor Hardin.

00:01:12.656 --> 00:01:13.573
I’m your daughter.

00:01:13.657 --> 00:01:14.992
Salvor Hardin?

00:01:15.117 --> 00:01:18.578
I definitely wanted her to be
somebody that people looked up
to.

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:21.123
Leah Harvey:
It’s nice to play somebody who’s
got a really wholesome

00:01:21.123 --> 00:01:23.125
Leah Harvey:
heart and real determination.

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:24.042
♪♪

00:01:24.042 --> 00:01:26.044
Leah Harvey:
In season one she’s not very
confident 

00:01:26.044 --> 00:01:27.671
Leah Harvey:
about the things that make her
different,

00:01:27.671 --> 00:01:30.132
Leah Harvey:
but in season two she’s gone
through a

00:01:30.132 --> 00:01:34.177
metamorphosis of appreciating
her differences and seeing
strength in them.

00:01:34.177 --> 00:01:37.973
Never let your sense of morals
prevent you from doing what’s
right.

00:01:39.141 --> 00:01:43.145
Gaal unexpectedly is reunited
with this daughter that she
didn’t know she had

00:01:43.312 --> 00:01:46.732
David Goyer:
and her daughter Salvor is
biologically older than she is. 

00:01:47.232 --> 00:01:48.859
Lou Llobell: 
Finding out she has a daughter.

00:01:48.984 --> 00:01:51.737
Dealing with the fact that she
hasn’t raised her daughter.

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:53.697
Lou Llobell: 
There’s so many factors that are

00:01:53.697 --> 00:01:57.200
Lou Llobell: 
effecting the way that she is
trying to interact with Salvor.

00:01:57.284 --> 00:02:00.078
It’s not the rosy reunion that
one would expect.

00:02:00.078 --> 00:02:02.122
They’ve got to earn that
relationship.

00:02:02.497 --> 00:02:03.915
Demerzel:
I will always be here,

00:02:04.207 --> 00:02:05.667
as I always have been.

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:12.424
David Goyer:
In season two, we start to
explore Demerzel’s relationship to Empire.

00:02:12.591 --> 00:02:14.968
David Goyer:
Is she a captive or a captor?

00:02:15.177 --> 00:02:17.596
Is she actually pulling the
strings of Empire?

00:02:17.888 --> 00:02:22.934
We see Demerzel leading Day
where she wants to, and we get
to see a little

00:02:22.934 --> 00:02:25.562
Laura Birn:
glimpse of how much power she
holds over him.

00:02:25.937 --> 00:02:29.274
Laura Birn:
She dreams of freedom and at the
same time

00:02:29.316 --> 00:02:32.944
her programming prevents her
from that dream coming true.

00:02:32.944 --> 00:02:34.738
Laura Birn:
That conflict is haunting.

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:35.989
Demerzel:
I’m left to wonder

00:02:36.365 --> 00:02:39.576
Demerzel:
if it weren’t for this
directive, would my feelings be the same? 

00:02:39.743 --> 00:02:40.869
Demerzel:
Would I feel anything? 

00:02:42.579 --> 00:02:44.831
There are a lot of new
characters who are gonna 

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:46.166
change the course of the show.

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:47.876
Will you serve me?

00:02:48.293 --> 00:02:49.836
I will serve Empire.

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:54.091
Alex Graves:
Queen Sareth has been chosen by
Day to be his bride.

00:02:54.716 --> 00:02:58.136
She brings a lot of feminine
power and energy into

00:02:58.136 --> 00:03:00.514
what is a very male dominated
space.

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:03.683
Day feels that he can steam-roll
her,

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:06.228
David Goyer:
but she turns out to be a quite
adept political

00:03:06.228 --> 00:03:08.647
David Goyer:
operative who really gives him a
run for his money.

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:11.566
It’s just a classic case of
never judge a book by it’s
cover.

00:03:11.733 --> 00:03:14.736
Ella-Rae Smith:
Just because a woman comes in
wearing high heels and a flirty dress

00:03:14.736 --> 00:03:16.363
doesn’t mean she’s not gonna to
ruin your life.

00:03:17.406 --> 00:03:19.241
Should I speak first, or will
you?

00:03:19.408 --> 00:03:20.242
Poly Verisof:
Constant!

00:03:20.659 --> 00:03:23.703
Brother Constant is a novice
in the Church of the Galactic
Spirit.

00:03:23.912 --> 00:03:26.415
She bounces around the galaxy
and the outer reach

00:03:26.415 --> 00:03:29.376
trying to evangelize the people
to the way of the Foundation.

00:03:29.584 --> 00:03:31.837
Isabella Laughland:
She's got a real sense of who
she is,

00:03:31.837 --> 00:03:35.006
Isabella Laughland:
and I think people sort of
mistake her as a young girl.

00:03:35.382 --> 00:03:36.466
And she's not at all.

00:03:36.842 --> 00:03:38.427
Isabella Laughland:
She doesn't take any crap from
anyone.

00:03:38.468 --> 00:03:39.886
♪♪

00:03:39.886 --> 00:03:40.929
(Door opens)

00:03:41.263 --> 00:03:45.308
Tellem Bond is an antagonist we
created for this series.

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:49.146
She will do whatever it takes
for eternal life.

00:03:49.271 --> 00:03:51.606
You are singular Gaal Dornick.

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:54.276
Rachel House:
She’s never come across anybody
as powerful as Gaal,

00:03:54.276 --> 00:03:56.319
Rachel House:
who can see the future.

00:03:56.695 --> 00:03:57.904
She may be a villain,

00:03:57.946 --> 00:03:59.364
David Goyer:
she may not be a villain.

00:03:59.614 --> 00:04:00.323
Salvor Hardin:
Buckle up.

00:04:01.199 --> 00:04:03.285
Season 2 is incredible.

00:04:03.326 --> 00:04:07.956
It really feels that David and
the team have just thrown
everything at this series.

00:04:08.039 --> 00:04:08.790
Do it!

00:04:08.832 --> 00:04:10.125
(Explosion)

00:04:10.208 --> 00:04:12.043
There’s so many amazing people
this season.

00:04:12.127 --> 00:04:14.004
Lou Llobell:
The casting and the storyline is
perfect

00:04:14.004 --> 00:04:15.672
and I just can’t wait to share
it with everyone.

00:04:15.797 --> 00:04:16.798
♪♪

00:04:16.798 --> 00:04:17.966
We will be ready.

00:04:18.008 --> 00:04:20.469
♪♪

